          <p>A web app that arranges packing cubes inside a suitcase, shows unused space, and suggests cube sizes that fit the remaining gaps.</p>
          <div class="links">
            <a href="https://luggage-packing-optimizer.ai.studio" target="_blank" rel="noopener">live ↗</a>
            <a href="https://github.com/bfung/luggage-pack" target="_blank" rel="noopener">code ↗</a>
          </div>
        </article>
        <article class="card rv" style="--d:160ms">
          <span class="idx">03</span>
          <h3>uMatrix Rule Generalizer</h3>
          <p>A developer tool to easily generalize rules for the uMatrix browser extension, helping filter host lists and domains.</p>
          <div class="links">
            <a href="https://bfung.github.io/uMatrixRuleGeneralizer/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">live ↗</a>
            <a href="https://github.com/bfung/uMatrixRuleGeneralizer" target="_blank" rel="noopener">code ↗</a>
          </div>
        </article>
      </div>
