        <p>Irvine, CA · remote-friendly. Fastest via any channel below.</p>
        <div class="linkrows">
          <a class="lrow" href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/bensonfung" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><span><span class="n">LinkedIn</span><br><span class="u">/in/bensonfung</span></span><span class="arr" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
